        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 848
        },
        "text": "The noise texture is projected on three axes (**Triplanar** kit) and the red channel is the dissolve pattern — dark = gone first."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fb923c",
        "id": "note_cut",
        "position": {
          "x": 1734,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 542
        },
        "text": "The **Soft Dissolve** kit turns *noise + amount* into an alpha mask and a thin edge band. Alpha feeds the alpha-clip; the band feeds emission."
      },
      {
        "color": "#f87171",
        "id": "note_emit",
        "position": {
          "x": 2480,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 542
        },
        "text": "`emission = edge × edge colour` (HDR). The surface itself stays a plain tinted dielectric."
      },
      {
